cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you refer to this network, please cite it as below.
title: The min-max route to finite extinction of Ricci flow
abstract: >-
  How sweepouts by 2-spheres force the Ricci flow with surgery to die in finite
  time: the width, its evolution inequality, and the extinction they force. A
  pre-formalization network — the argument in prose, with every statement it
  turns on as a separate addressable card and the dependencies between those
  statements as edges.
